abstract: >
  Infrastructure for converting clinical case descriptions into ontology-linked
  clinical state representations. v0.1.2 includes the annotation schema, a
  synthetic example, and validation tooling. Source texts, surface forms, spans,
  and identifiers are NOT redistributed.

